\
class Bot(VirxERLU):\
&#x20;   \# If the bot encounters an error, VirxERLU will do it's best to keep the bot from crashing.\
&#x20;   \# VirxERLU uses a stack system for it's routines. A stack is a first-in, last-out system of routines.\
